          "heading": "Fiji enter talks with Warren Gatland as Shaun Edwards is linked",
          "body": "Fiji are reportedly in talks with former Wales boss Warren Gatland over their head coach vacancy, with defensive mastermind Shaun Edwards also linked to the setup. Gatland has entered a two-horse race for the 2027 Rugby World Cup cycle alongside former Springboks coach Jake White, who remains a strong favourite. The Fiji Rugby Union is whittling down a shortlist of 31 applicants to succeed Mick Byrne, aiming to make an appointment before November's Nations Championship matches."
