          "heading": "Josh Adams eyes third World Cup as he nears playing return",
          "body": "Wales wing Josh Adams has declared his determination to feature in a third consecutive World Cup, with the tournament in Australia now exactly one year away. Despite missing the summer defeat to South Africa with a calf injury, the 31-year-old is closing in on a return to action for Cardiff. “I am training, but it’s important that you navigate your way through correctly and there’s no rush,” Adams said. He is currently focused on regaining full fitness for international duty."
