          "body": "Wallabies back-rower Fraser McReight has opened up on the challenging feedback he received from former Australia head coach Dave Rennie during his early Test career. Now a 46-cap regular under Les Kiss, McReight credited those difficult early dialogues with helping him understand the preparation required for international rugby. As he prepares to face Rennie’s New Zealand side this weekend, McReight insisted that while Australia possess the belief to compete, they must remain focused on the tactical threats the hosts will pose."
