          "heading": "Ryan Lonergan credits Japanese player Kaito Shigeno for passing consistency",
          "body": "Wallabies scrum-half Ryan Lonergan has revealed that his refined passing technique is the result of using specialist grip tape recommended by Kaito Shigeno. The pair connected while playing for the Barbarians in 2023, where Lonergan observed the Japanese half-back applying the tape to improve his grip. Lonergan now utilizes the method exclusively during matches to maintain consistency in wet conditions, noting that he sources the specific tape whenever he visits Japan for fixtures."
